OL,4,CFarage helps launch new campaign       
OL,5,Cagainst the UK rejoining the EU        
OL,6,GNigel Farage has helped launch a new   
OL,7,Gcampaign against the UK rejoining the  
OL,8,GEuropean Union.                        
OL,10,FThe Reform UK leader offered his       
OL,11,Fsupport to Keep Britain Out, which     
OL,12,Fsees him reunite with his Brexit-      
OL,13,Fsupporting ally Arron Banks - who co-  
OL,14,Ffounded the Leave.EU campaign during   
OL,15,Fthe 2016 referendum.                   
OL,17,FFarage was the first MP to sign the    
OL,18,Fcampaign's "Pledge for Britain". This  
OL,19,Fcontains "10 commitments" for elected  
OL,20,Fofficials to abide by, including       
OL,21,Fopposing rejoining the EU, its single  
OL,22,Fmarket or customs union.          G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
